  "name": "ACE-Step 1.5 Turbo · musique locale",
  "section": "audio",
  "pack": "audio-ace15",
  "status": "ready",
  "summary": "Génération musicale native ComfyUI sur Radeon 780M, ACE-Step 1.5 Turbo 2B, encodeurs Qwen 0,6B + 1,7B et VAE.",
  "workflow": "workflow.api.json",
  "source": {
    "template": "audio_ace_step_1_5_split.json",
    "comfyui": "0.45.0",
    "notes": "Native ComfyUI split workflow for ACE-Step 1.5 Turbo on Radeon 780M. Native audio decoding uses 128-frame tiles with 32-frame overlap. The 30-second default, eight Turbo steps and direct conditioning passed the Freefield CLI end to end on Cloud9 (80.6 s; 48 kHz stereo MP3). The optional Qwen musical planner and longer durations have not been qualified by this test."
  },
